{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Stand Legends Demo</strong> throws you into a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies, ghouls, and mutated beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo version offers a Short part of the Campaign mode, which can be played.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Campaign Mode:</strong> Play Part of the Single Player Campaign Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Join forces with players online to survive the undead hordes together in the part of the campaign mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Action-Packed Combat:</strong>\u00a0Engage in fast-paced battles using a variety of weapons and abilities to slay zombies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get a feeling of the game experience before Early Access in 2025!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761600?t=1748380965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761600?t=1748380965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761600/33431bb8594abcf0a606f1f79e4685836e810477/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748380965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761600/33431bb8594abcf0a606f1f79e4685836e810477/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748380965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Last Stand Legends features intense violence and gore consistent with a post-apocalyptic zombie survival game. \r\nPlayers will encounter graphic depictions of combat, including blood, dismemberment, and gruesome undead enemies such as zombies, mutated creatures, and bosses. \r\nThe game contains scenes of horror and unsettling imagery typical of the zombie genre.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, or non-consensual content. \r\nSubstance abuse, including drug or alcohol use, is not a focal theme and is only referenced indirectly through fictional experimental substances used by certain characters (e.g., the \"Crazy Scientist\" boss\u2019s green goo). \r\n\r\nThere are no portrayals of self-harm.\r\n\r\nMature language may be present in dialogue reflecting the harsh and desperate world setting. \r\nOverall, the game is intended for mature audiences due to its violent and horror themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Stand Legends Demo</strong> throws you into a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies, ghouls, and mutated beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo version offers a Short part of the Campaign mode, which can be played.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Campaign Mode:</strong> Play Part of the Single Player Campaign Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Join forces with players online to survive the undead hordes together in the part of the campaign mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Action-Packed Combat:</strong>\u00a0Engage in fast-paced battles using a variety of weapons and abilities to slay zombies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get a feeling of the game experience before Early Access in 2025!</strong></p>","developers":["Risen Realms"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3670060","name